---
// Quiz figure for Post 8 (macro and industry).
---
<div class="qfig-sbq08twocompanies">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 156" role="img" aria-label="Two assumed companies: an exporter with USD 10 million revenue and 200 billion VND costs earns 30 billion at 23,000; an importer with 250 billion sales, USD 8 million inputs and 40 billion other costs earns 26 billion.">
<rect x="16" y="12" width="262" height="130" rx="8" class="cardk" />
<rect x="302" y="12" width="262" height="130" rx="8" class="cardr" />
<text x="30" y="38" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Exporter</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhà xuất khẩu</tspan></text>
<text x="316" y="38" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Importer</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhà nhập khẩu</tspan></text>
<text x="30" y="62" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Revenue USD 10m</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Doanh thu 10 triệu USD</tspan></text>
<text x="30" y="82" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>VND costs 200 bn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chi phí VND 200 tỷ</tspan></text>
<text x="316" y="62" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Sales 250 bn VND</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bán 250 tỷ VND</tspan></text>
<text x="316" y="82" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Inputs USD 8m, other costs 40 bn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nguyên liệu 8 triệu USD, chi phí khác 40 tỷ</tspan></text>
<text x="30" y="112" class="grn"><tspan data-lang-en>Profit at 23,000: 30 bn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi ở 23.000: 30 tỷ</tspan></text>
<text x="316" y="112" class="red"><tspan data-lang-en>Profit at 23,000: 26 bn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi ở 23.000: 26 tỷ</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .b { font-size: 12.5px; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .qfig-sbq08twocompanies .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
